[{"id":"CN-HTTP-011","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","代理","502","504"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>遇到 502 或 504，如何区别网关和上游问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认错误响应由哪个网关产生，再沿客户端到网关、网关到上游、上游内部的时间线检查 DNS、TCP、TLS、响应格式和超时。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>502 通常表示网关从上游得到无效响应，504 表示等待上游超时；状态码不能替代网关日志和上游证据，也不能直接指向某一段代码。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把网关问题拆成两段链路：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>链路\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>证据\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>客户端 → 网关\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>DNS、TCP、TLS、请求是否到达\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>网关 → 上游\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>上游 DNS、连接、响应格式、超时\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>502 更接近“上游响应无效”，504 更接近“等待上游超时”；状态码本身不能定位具体代码行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-execution-phases","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["执行模型"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(二)测试基础与执行模型","articlePath":"posts/9d696b94/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一次 Pytest 运行包含哪些阶段，失败阶段会怎样影响结果？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按启动、收集、setup、call、teardown、报告和退出码理解；setup 失败不会进入 call，teardown 失败会追加清理错误。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先确认目标是否进入收集树，再定位失败阶段。一个最小测试的证据链可以写成：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">collect → setup(Fixture) → call(测试体) → teardown → report → exit code\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>例如，Fixture 在 \u003ccode>setup\u003c/code> 阶段抛错时，测试函数根本不会执行；测试体断言失败通常出现在 \u003ccode>call\u003c/code>；清理代码抛错则会在原结果之外追加 teardown 错误。\u003ccode>failed\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>error\u003c/code> 都要结合回溯、Node ID 与退出码判断，不能只看终端颜色。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-fixture-teardown-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["资源清理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期","articlePath":"posts/97e28b51/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期","articlePath":"posts/97e28b51/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 的清理顺序如何确定？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按依赖建立顺序的逆序清理；已经建立的每个资源都应在测试失败时执行自己的清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>清理顺序是依赖建立顺序的逆序：\u003ccode>order -&gt; repository -&gt; tmp_path\u003c/code>。把资源写成显式依赖，Pytest 才知道在部分失败时应该清理什么：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">repository\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    db = tmp_path / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;orders.db&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    db.touch()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">yield\u003c/span> db\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    db.unlink(missing_ok=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># repository 自己负责释放\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">order\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">repository\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">yield\u003c/span> repository / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;order-1&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果 \u003ccode>order\u003c/code> 建立失败，已完成的 \u003ccode>repository\u003c/code> 仍会执行自己的 teardown；\u003ccode>yield\u003c/code> 之后的清理代码和 \u003ccode>addfinalizer\u003c/code> 都必须考虑“资源只建立了一半”以及清理自身抛错的情况。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-suite-fixture-design","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["项目设计"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>项目 Fixture 应按什么原则拆分？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按资源所有权、生命周期和隔离边界拆分，让每个 Fixture 有单一职责并能可靠清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 的边界应同时回答三个问题：谁拥有资源、资源活多久、失败后谁负责清理。可以把同一个项目拆成独立依赖：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture(\u003cspan class=\"params\">scope=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;session&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">config\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> load_config()       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 只读配置可共享\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">order_file\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> tmp_path / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;order.json&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 写入状态按测试隔离\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>测试函数只声明实际需要的 Fixture，避免一个巨型 Fixture 同时创建数据库、用户、网络客户端和报告附件。共享只读数据才适合提升作用域；写入状态和临时文件通常保持 function 级并在 teardown 中清理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-route-actions","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["网络Mock","Route"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>需要模拟推荐接口断网时，应使用哪种路由动作？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code> 注入网络失败；\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code> 返回模拟响应；\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code> 修改后继续发送真实请求。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>三个路由动作对应三种证据：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>请求后续\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>适用场景\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>continue_()\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>继续真实请求\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只改请求后放行\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>fulfill()\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>返回测试构造的响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>稳定模拟服务结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>abort()\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>直接制造网络失败\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>验证断网、错误 UI\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>选择动作前先定义被测系统应该看到什么；不要用 abort 代替真实服务错误，也不要用 fulfill 假装已经验证了后端兼容性。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-download-lifecycle","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["下载","生命周期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>expect_download()\u003c/code> 返回 Download 对象后，还要验证哪些边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先判断 \u003ccode>failure()\u003c/code>，再按运行环境选择 \u003ccode>path()\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>save_as()\u003c/code>，并在 Context 关闭前完成读取或保存。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>下载事件只证明对象已产生；临时路径受生命周期和远程连接影响，保存到受控目录比长期依赖临时路径更稳定。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>下载对象产生后仍有三个检查点：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> page.expect_download() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> info:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;导出&quot;\u003c/span>).click()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">download = info.value\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> download.failure() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">download.save_as(output_path)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>事件只说明下载对象出现；failure 判断传输结果，save_as 把文件放入受控目录，并且要在 Context 关闭前完成保存。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-runtime-thread-process-async","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","threading","multiprocessing","asyncio"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十)内存、并发与性能.md","articleTitle":"Python(十)内存、并发与性能","articlePath":"posts/fa1b960c/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>线程、进程和 asyncio 如何按任务选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>阻塞 I/O 常用线程，CPU 密集且可序列化的任务常用进程，大量可等待 I/O 且链路可 async 时用 asyncio。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三者的差异可以落到共享模型和让出点：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">async\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">fetch_two\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 协程只有在 await 处主动让出执行权。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">await\u003c/span> asyncio.gather(fetch(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;\u003c/span>), fetch(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;b&quot;\u003c/span>))\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>线程共享进程内对象，需要锁或队列；进程默认隔离内存，需要序列化和消息协议；协程通常共享一个线程，只在 \u003ccode>await\u003c/code> 等协作点切换。先测量是 I/O、CPU 还是同步开销，再选择依赖库支持的最小复杂度方案。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]